{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本文部科學省於2026年10月23日公佈本年度文化勳章獲頒者，任天堂代表董事兼Fellow宮本茂入選，其長期推動遊戲產業及互動娛樂在全球發展的貢獻獲得評價。宮本茂此前已於2019年獲選文化功勞者。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1583534.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:03:50.490152+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:58:04.723345+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:58:04.723345+00:00","content_hash":"2195e1b8401b908884d20d0705588b95f24813eac145d99830f2e29aba4d97da","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}